cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ThetaOptimality in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: ThetaOptimality
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: AGPL-3.0-only
authors:
  - family-names: Myers
    given-names: Richard
abstract: >-
  A C++20 header-only library for a theta-consistent discrete optimality
  system, including forward, tangent linear, discrete adjoint, reduced
  gradient, and incremental-adjoint Hessian-vector calculations. Analytical
  and engineering examples test convergence, inverse-problem information,
  uncertainty, and state qualification.
